        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4812, Craftsman Full Length Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Full Length Craftsman Handleset is an old classic that speaks of the craftmanship that used to go into every piece of door hardware. The Craftsman Full Length Handleset is available in 4 authentic finishes and comes with your choice of interior knob or lever. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Full Escutcheon Plate Arts and Crafts Front Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Arts and Crafts Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Deadbolt and Lever Latch: 5-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4802-specifications.pdf?v=1704262353\"><b>Emtek 4812 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4-finish.jpg?v=1704354746\" width=\"339\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Full Length Craftsman Handleset",
                "description": "The Full Length Craftsman Handleset is an old classic that speaks of the craftmanship that used to go into every piece of door hardware. The Craftsman Full Length Handleset is available in 4 authentic finishes and comes with your choice of interior knob or lever. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from single cylinder or dummy functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek Craftsman Entrance Handlesets, Full Escutcheon Plate Arts and Crafts Front Door Handles, Arts & Crafts Full Length Handlesets, Craftsman Full Length Handlesets, Full Length Arts and Crafts Handlesets, EMT-4812, Emtek 4812, Emtek 4802, Solid Brass Arts and Crafts Pulls, traditional door pulls, southwest door handles,"
